next forever/horde/30-40/04-stranglethorn-vale

# Consensus route (Horde Tauren export), visit 24 part 2/3 (Stranglethorn
# Vale 34.4-35.9), shared by every Horde start.
#
# Flow: Grom'gol (where the previous guide ends) -> the Vile Reef -> the
# Bloodscalp ruins -> Grom'gol -> Nesingwary's camp (Panther Mastery, The
# Green Hills of Stranglethorn) -> pages from the trolls; the next guide
# starts with a hearth to Grom'gol.
#
# Optional extras: The Green Hills of Stranglethorn (338-342): its pages
# drop at about 1% each from the vale's trolls (or buy them); the export
# counts the hunt for them. The chapters are handed in by
# 04-stranglethorn-vale.
#
# Deviations from the export: none in the quest set. The Vile Reef is done
# first, on the way north to the ruins.
#
# Class quests: none on this stretch.
#
# Carried on: Marg Speaks (1261) for Dustwallow Marsh; Panther Mastery (192)
# and the Green Hills chapters for 04-stranglethorn-vale.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Vile Reef and the Bloodscalp ruins

step The Vile Reef
  tip North-west of Grom'gol the Vile Reef lies under the water off the coast. The Tablet Shard rests on the sea floor by the sunken ruins; watch your breath and the murlocs.
  collect 4094 quest 629 @24.8,22.9

step Bloodscalp ruins
  tip The Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins up the coast north of the reef and the village beyond; every one can drop a Bloody Bone Necklace. Keep looting pages of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn.
  goto 26.0,16.0 "Bloodscalp ruins"
  collect 3915 quest 596

step Grom'gol
  tip Ride back south to Grom'gol. The bubbling cauldron beside Kin'weelay holds Marg's note.
  turnin 596                          -- Kin'weelay
  turnin 629
  accept 1261                         -- Bubbling Cauldron: for Dustwallow Marsh, later on the route

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nesingwary's camp

step Nesingwary's camp
  tip Follow the road north to the camp.
  accept 192                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  accept 338 optional                 -- Barnil Stonepot
  accept 339 optional
  accept 340 optional
  accept 341 optional
  accept 342 optional

step Green Hills pages
  tip Pages of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn drop at about 1% each from the Bloodscalp and Skullsplitter trolls; keep every page you loot and look on the auction house for the rest. Barnil takes the chapters in the next guide, which starts with a hearth to Grom'gol.
  collect 2725 quest 339.1 optional
  collect 2728 quest 339.2 optional
  collect 2730 quest 339.3 optional
  collect 2732 quest 339.4 optional
  collect 2734 quest 340.1 optional
  collect 2735 quest 340.2 optional
  collect 2738 quest 340.3 optional
  collect 2740 quest 340.4 optional
  collect 2742 quest 341.1 optional
  collect 2744 quest 341.2 optional
  collect 2745 quest 341.3 optional
  collect 2748 quest 341.4 optional
  collect 2749 quest 342.1 optional
  collect 2750 quest 342.2 optional
  collect 2751 quest 342.3 optional
